      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank VRChat for releasing Dynamic Image feature in near the future. I understand that you are aiming to provide Dynamic Image as a world function now. I am looking forward to this.\nThe additional request has come to my mind recently. A dynamic image feature for avatars is useful for presentations in the VRChat world. The expected specification is to provide for avatar, a 3D plate object (world fixable) that displays any image selected from the images registered in the gallery at any time.\nIf we upload the page image of the presentation material, as Photos in  the gallery menu on the VRChat web, we can explain while displaying the selected page image.\nI think this request can be made even after the release of the function you are currently working on. Thank you.",
